INSERT INTO `blog` (`blogid`, `cleanurl`, `author`, `title`, `descr`, `fulldescr`, `meta_title`, `meta_keywords`, `meta_descr`, `active`, `date`) VALUES
(2, 'spa-cart', '1', 'SPA Cart for building the perfect ecommerce platform', '<p>When choosing the perfect CMS for building and running a seamless eCommerce platform, many factors come into play. From the speed of your website to its aesthetics, the right CMS tool has to offer a wide range of features that makes your platform user-friendly, visually appealing, and, more importantly, functional.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Although there are many CMS in the market, there are several reasons why some eCommerce website owners choose SPA Cart over others. SPA stands for Single Page Application, and it&#39;s a content management system (CMS) with tons of features that help make building and running an eCommerce website easy as pie. No more worrying about slow site speed, page reloading, and a host of other challenges common with other CMS.</p>\r\n', '<p>When choosing the perfect CMS for building and running a seamless eCommerce platform, many factors come into play. From the speed of your website to its aesthetics, the right CMS tool has to offer a wide range of features that makes your platform user-friendly, visually appealing, and, more importantly, functional.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Although there are many CMS in the market, there are several reasons why some eCommerce website owners choose SPA Cart over others. SPA stands for Single Page Application, and it&#39;s a content management system (CMS) with tons of features that help make building and running an eCommerce website easy as pie. No more worrying about slow site speed, page reloading, and a host of other challenges common with other CMS.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Some core reasons why SPA Cart is the perfect tool for building eCommerce websites include:</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>1. It&#39;s highly customizable</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>There&#39;s virtually no restriction on how creative you can go with SPA Cart. You can choose your design theme color, scale your website,&nbsp; and perform a variety of tricks to build that one-of-a-kind website you&#39;ve always wanted.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>2. Amazing load speed</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>One of the key factors determining the success of an eCommerce website is its load speed. Considering that there are endless products to view and users have limited time, having a poor load speed can easily bore users and make them leave your site without patronage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On the other hand, a super-fast website will help users to navigate the length and breadth of your eCommerce platform easily and prefer shopping on your website over others.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>3. Unlimited options</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Your eCommerce website will regularly receive updates and expand its scope over time. The categories, news, blogs, and products will grow in number as your business progresses.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Building your website on a limited CMS may cause serious business challenges when your online eCommerce store grows significantly across the years. You don&#39;t want to keep moving from one tool to another as that may interrupt operations and wouldn&#39;t portray your brand as being unreliable.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Relying on a tool such as SPA Cart, which has unlimited features, allows you to grow your business without worrying about overburdening your tool. You get unlimited:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Categories</li>\r\n	<li>Blogs</li>\r\n	<li>Static pages</li>\r\n	<li>News</li>\r\n	<li>Testimonials</li>\r\n	<li>Etc</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Finally, there are lots of other features SPA Cart provides that can take your eCommerce platform to the next level, including responsiveness, banners, support desk, multi-language, multi-currency, etc.</p>\r\n', '', '', '', 'Y', 1411749412);
